WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:03.900
SCP-096 Vs SCP-173.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:09.930
The Sinister Shy Guy Vs the Serial Killing
Sculpture - Two iconic SCP Foundation monsters,

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:11.350
but who would win in a fight?

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:16.160
Not only is 173 so dangerous that even 682
is afraid of it, but it also has some key

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:17.960
advantages over 096.

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:23.509
096 is only dangerous in its rage state, activated
by somebody looking at its face.

00:00:23.509 --> 00:00:28.050
But seeing as 173 doesn’t exactly “look”,
it’s likely it would never even activate

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:29.769
096’s rage state.

00:00:29.769 --> 00:00:32.850
Personally, our money would definitely be
on the Sculpture here.

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:36.870
173 would be as deadly as ever, happily snapping
096’s neck.

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:43.710
It’s unlikely this would kill 096, but it’d
at least be a clear symbolic victory for SCP-173.

